    <bf:tableOfContents>
      <bf:TableOfContents>
	<rdfs:label>[v. 1] Overture ; Oh, what a beautiful mornin' ; Surrey with the fringe on top ; Kansas City ; I cain't say no ; Many a new day ; People will say we're in love ; Pore Jud is daid ; Out of my dreams ; All er nothin' ; Oklahoma ; Finale -- v. 2. Lonely room ; It's a scandal ; The farmer and the cowman.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:TableOfContents>
    </bf:tableOfContents>
